# "Exile it at the beginning of the next end step": cast during the end step of turn 3 the beginning of that step is already
# past, so the next end step is the one of turn 4 (CR 603.7, 513). The Ornithopter returned in Bot1's end step is still on the
# battlefield during Bot2's turn 4 (a blocker there) and is exiled only at Bot2's end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Corpse Dance
Swamp
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Corpse Dance.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Types = Artifact; Creature
[T4 Bot2.End]
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Cleanup]

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Corpse Dance; Lightning Bolt
